{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0266","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000181:text","row":36201,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「うおおー、揺れるとジンジン響くですー」","en":"“Oooh, every little jolt makes it throb!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900963","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00001","en":"Miki: \"Uwoooh, when you move it the tingle tingle spreads arouuund!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:000001c9:text","row":36202,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「我慢しろ、今名医を召還してやる」","en":"“Hang in there. I'll summon a renowned physician.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900964","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00002","en":"Taichi: \"Bear with it, I'm going to summon a famed physician now.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000203:text","row":36203,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"窓をあけて、口笛を吹いた。","en":"I opened the window and whistled.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900965","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00003","en":"I opened the window and whistled.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000253:text","row":36204,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"カムヒア！　ヨーコ！","en":"Come here, Youko!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900966","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00004","en":"C'mere! Youko!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000287:text","row":36205,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900967","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00005","en":"Taichi: \"......\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:000002ab:text","row":36206,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"来ないな。","en":"She's not coming.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900968","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00006","en":"She doesn't come.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:000002cd:text","row":36207,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"再度、口笛を吹いた。","en":"I whistled again.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900969","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00007","en":"Once again, I whistle.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000317:text","row":36208,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"カムヒアッ！　ヨーコッ！","en":"Come here! Youko!","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900970","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00008","en":"COME HERE! YOUKO!","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:000003b0:text","row":36209,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"「……………………」","en":"“................”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900971","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00009","en":"Taichi: \"............\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:000003dc:text","row":36210,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"あれえ。","en":"What gives?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900972","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00010","en":"Well now.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000421:text","row":36211,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「すんごく裂けてます、わたしの腕」","en":"“My arm is split wide open.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900973","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00011","en":"Miki: \"This arm of mine is trrremendously torn open.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000463:text","row":36212,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"「あわわ」","en":"“A-awawa.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900974","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00012","en":"Taichi: \"AhWahWah!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000485:text","row":36213,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"仕方ない、俺が手当てするしか。","en":"No choice. I'd have to patch her up myself.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900975","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00013","en":"No avoiding this, then, I'll just have to just administer aid myself won't I.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:000004bb:text","row":36214,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"袖をまくりあげる。","en":"I rolled up her sleeve.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900976","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00014","en":"I roll up her sleeve,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:000004e5:text","row":36215,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"傷口のある部分を見る。","en":"I inspected the wound.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900977","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00015","en":"to see the area where the mouth of the cut is.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:0000051b:text","row":36216,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「う……」","en":"“Ugh...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900978","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00016","en":"Taichi: \"Ngh...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:0000053d:text","row":36217,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"やっぱり血の匂いはきつい。","en":"The smell of blood was still too much for me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900979","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00017","en":"The odor of blood is harsh as I expected.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:0000056f:text","row":36218,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"洗濯ばさみで鼻をつまんだ。","en":"I pinched my nose shut with a clothespin.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900980","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00018","en":"I pinch down my nose with a clothespin.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000627:text","row":36219,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"「それは？」","en":"“What’s that for?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900981","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00019","en":"Miki: \"What's that?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000653:text","row":36220,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「ごねでのし（これでよし）」","en":"“Buch better.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900982","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00020","en":"Taichi: \"Dish bill be bine (this will be fine).\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:0000070d:text","row":36221,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「……まさか治療の一環？」","en":"“...Is that somehow part of the treatment?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900983","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00021","en":"Miki: \"...don't tell me that's part of the medical treatment?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:0000073f:text","row":36222,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"勝手に納得してくれた。","en":"She supplied her own explanation.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900984","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00022","en":"I let her draw whatever conclusion she liked.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:0000076d:text","row":36223,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"ええと……まず水で……。","en":"Let's see... water first...","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900985","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00023","en":"Uhmmm... first, water...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:0000079d:text","row":36224,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"洗面器の水で、血を洗い流す。","en":"I washed the blood off with water from the basin.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900986","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00024","en":"I was away the blood with the water in the rinse basin.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese says he washes the blood away with water from the basin. The English's 'was away' is not a grammatical rendering of that action and leaves the procedure unclear.","remedy":"I wash the blood away with water from the basin.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":20,"start":0,"text":"I was away the blood"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:000007d1:text","row":36225,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"ほっとする。","en":"That helped.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900987","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00025","en":"Relieved sigh.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:000007fd:text","row":36226,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「……………………」","en":"“................”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900988","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00026","en":"Miki: \"............\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000829:text","row":36227,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"美希は俺を推し量るように、じっと見つめていた。","en":"Miki watched me closely, sizing me up.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900989","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00027","en":"Miki was staring at me, fixed, as if conjecturing about me.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:0000086f:text","row":36228,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"消毒……。","en":"Disinfectant next...","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900990","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00028","en":"Disinfectant...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000917:text","row":36229,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「みぎゃー」","en":"“Migyaaa!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900991","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00029","en":"Miki: \"Mgh'yaaah!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:0000093b:text","row":36230,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"染みたらしい。","en":"That must have stung.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900992","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00030","en":"Looks like it permeated.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese says the disinfectant apparently stung the wound. 'Permeated' describes soaking or penetration and does not convey the painful sensation demonstrated by her cry.","remedy":"Looks like that stung.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":24,"start":0,"text":"Looks like it permeated."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000961:text","row":36231,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"もういっちょ。","en":"Another dose.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900993","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00031","en":"Once moah'.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000a0d:text","row":36232,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「はぎゃー」","en":"“Hagyaaa!”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900994","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00032","en":"Miki: \"Hgh'yaaah!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000a31:text","row":36233,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"こんなもんか。","en":"That ought to do it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900995","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00033","en":"Like this I guess.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000a57:text","row":36234,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"ガーゼ。","en":"Gauze.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900996","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00034","en":"Gauze.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000a77:text","row":36235,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"包帯。","en":"Bandage.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900997","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00035","en":"Dressing.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000a95:text","row":36236,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"包帯どめ。","en":"Bandage clip.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900998","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00036","en":"Dressing's crap.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","word_choice"],"assessment":"The Japanese names a bandage fastener or clip as the next medical item. The English instead makes a derogatory statement that the dressing is bad.","remedy":"Bandage clip.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":16,"start":0,"text":"Dressing's crap."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000ab7:text","row":36237,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"そでを戻す。","en":"Sleeve back down.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:900999","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00037","en":"I roll down the sleeve.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000ae3:text","row":36238,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"「ふう」","en":"“Whew.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901000","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00038","en":"Taichi: \"Whew.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000b03:text","row":36239,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"洗濯ばさみはもういらない。","en":"I took off the clothespin.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901001","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00039","en":"I don't need the clothespin anymore.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000b42:text","row":36240,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"「オペ終了」","en":"“Operation complete.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901002","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00040","en":"Taichi: \"Surgery completed.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000bec:text","row":36241,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ジンジンします、傷口が痺れる感じです」","en":"“...It's throbbing. The cut feels all tingly.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901003","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00041","en":"Miki: \"...I'm still tingly, and I feel numb around the cut.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000c38:text","row":36242,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「それは恋だ」","en":"“That's love.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901004","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00042","en":"Taichi: \"That's the love.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000ce4:text","row":36243,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"「こ、これが恋」","en":"“Th-this is love?”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901005","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00043","en":"Miki: \"Th-, this is love.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000d14:text","row":36244,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"「しかもトゥルーラブだ。好感度は８９％。間違いないね」","en":"“True love, no less. Affection level: eighty-nine percent. No question.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901006","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00044","en":"Taichi: \"Furthermore, it's Twue Wuv. Favorability rating at 89%. No mistake about it.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000de8:text","row":36245,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「そーかー。これが恋……」","en":"“I see... So this is love...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901007","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00045","en":"Miki: \"So it is. This is love...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000e34:text","row":36246,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「恋の花咲く気分はどうか」","en":"“How does it feel to have love in bloom?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901008","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00046","en":"Taichi: \"How does it feel for your love to bloom?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000eec:text","row":36247,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"「……わかりません。恋する間もない人生でした」","en":"“...I don't know. My life ended before I got a chance to fall in love.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901009","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00047","en":"Miki: \"...I don't get it. I have never fallen in love not once in my life.\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["undertranslation","tense_aspect"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000f3a:text","row":36248,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"「くっ、泣かせやがる」","en":"“Damn. That's enough to make a man cry.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901010","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00048","en":"Taichi: \"Sob, you're making me cry.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00000fee:text","row":36249,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"「というか、血の苦手な先輩に手当てさせちゃってすみません」","en":"“Seriously, though—sorry I made you treat me when you can’t stand blood.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901011","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00049","en":"Miki: \"Or, should I say, sorry for having you give me medical assistance when blood is your weak spot, Senpai.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00001048:text","row":36250,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"「なに。医者もいないし、怪我は一大事だ。自愛してくれ」","en":"“Don't worry about it. There are no doctors left, and injuries are serious. Take care of yourself.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901012","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00050","en":"Taichi: \"What for. There's no doctors anymore, injuries are a very big deal. We gotta take care of ourselves.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","logical_relation"],"assessment":"The Japanese directly tells Miki to take care of herself because injuries are serious without a doctor. The English generalizes the instruction into a mutual 'we,' weakening the personal concern that prompts her reply.","remedy":"Take good care of yourself.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":109,"start":77,"text":"We gotta take care of ourselves."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:0000111c:text","row":36251,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"「自愛してます……すごく……」","en":"“Oh, I take very good care of myself... very good...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901013","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00051","en":"Miki: \"Take care of ourselves... very much so...\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["wrong_subject","grammar"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:0000115a:text","row":36252,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"「ならよし」","en":"“Then we're good.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901014","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00052","en":"Taichi: \"It'll go fine.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00001204:text","row":36253,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"「なにかお礼しないといけないですね」","en":"“I need to thank you somehow.”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901015","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00053","en":"Miki: \"I still feel I must give some as an expression of gratitude.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00001248:text","row":36254,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"「下着の一枚でもくれれば」","en":"“One pair of panties will do.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901016","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00054","en":"Taichi: \"If you would give me one pair of underwear, then.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:00001300:text","row":36255,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"「……うーおー、たけぇ……」","en":"“...Whoa. That's expensive...”","speakerJa":"美希","speakerEn":"Miki","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:901017","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccc4007:00055","en":"Miki: \"...whoooa, steeep...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0266:0000133c:text","row":36256,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"「冗談だ。霧ちんに殺される」","en":"“Kidding. Kiri-kins would kill me.”","speakerJ